{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/828602-lost-breed-renown","id":828602,"title":"Lost Breed renown","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-11T21:53:00-08:00","id":828602,"title":"Lost Breed renown","content":"If this question was already answered I apologize. What are the renown for the three lost breeds; Apis, camazots, Grondr?<br /> I feel like the camazots should be similar to the corax but with cunning instead of one of the other three. I figure the Grondr and Apis should be similar to Gurahl with there renown. Any help anyone would provide would be much appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11219-vikingsean711","name":"Vikingsean711","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-13T08:02:20-08:00","id":829246,"title":"","content":"I honestly do not know, and currently haven't found anything.<br /> <br /> I think you could be onto something with the bats having Cunning like the Spiders do. Perhaps instead of honor. So Glory, Cunning and Wisdom.<br /> <br /> The Apis always seemed similar to the Gurahl (Bears) for some reason to me. Perhaps their dealings as Match Makers. Glory and Wisdom seem solid, Honor could fit just as well too if not Succor like the bears.<br /> <br /> as for the Grondr (pigs), straight up Glory, Honor and wisdom for me.<br /> <br /> Perhaps Shattered Dreams will answer some of this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-13T08:03:03-08:00","id":829248,"title":"","content":"As well as maybe their Litanys *fingers crossed*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T00:06:08-08:00","id":829603,"title":"","content":"I think we need breed books for all three. Without looking and since a real life incident is making it difficult to move right now I would use Corax renown for the Camazotz. The Apis I would use Gurahl renown. Grondr I would be tempted to replace Glory with Ferocity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T02:45:34-08:00","id":829633,"title":"","content":"I think we should want for Breedbooks too. I dont need it, but I want it. Yes I do <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> or perhaps a Lost Breeds Book that covers all three and perhaps something that hints at the other lesser known extinxt Fera. I heard something about were-Eagles and Falcons, Were-crustaceans that were at war (abd lost) to the Rokea, or that could just be whispers and thoughts from other players over the years.<br /> <br /> That's a good call of Ferocity for Grondr Incbill. I like it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T06:36:47-08:00","id":829689,"title":"","content":"A Lost-Breed Book could also have some of the Insects gone extinct by the hands of the Ananasi.<br /> <br /> But for the Renown: I would mostly go as <b>Somuchlove</b> suggested, but taking out Glory instead for Camazotz and Apis. Camazotz seem like the kind that would be a lot more low-profile, and I don't see Glory being used by such a bunch. Almost the same goes for Apis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}